stream
BT
/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 762.8 Tm (1 Safety Instructions) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 746.8 Tm (Read all instructions before installing the router. Keep this manual for future) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 730.9 Tm (reference.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 714.9 Tm (Use only the 12 V / 1.5 A power adapter supplied in the box \(model PA-1215\). Using a) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 699.0 Tm (different adapter can damage the router and voids the warranty.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 683.0 Tm (Operating temperature is 0 to 40 degrees Celsius. Do not place the router in direct) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 667.1 Tm (sunlight, near a heater, or inside a closed metal cabinet.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 651.1 Tm (Keep at least 20 cm between the antennas and the body of any person during operation.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 635.2 Tm (Do not open the housing. There are no user-serviceable parts inside. Opening the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 619.2 Tm (housing voids the warranty.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 603.3 Tm (Unplug the router during lightning storms or when it will not be used for a long time.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 36 Tm (NetPro X200 User Manual | NP-X200-UM-EN rev C | Page 2 of 14) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
