/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 762.8 Tm (2 Package Contents and Specifications) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 743.9 Tm (2.1 Package contents) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728.0 Tm (One NetPro X200 router, one 12 V power adapter \(PA-1215\), one 1.5 m Cat6 Ethernet) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712.0 Tm (cable, a quick installation guide and a warranty card.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 693.2 Tm (2.2 Technical specifications) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 677.2 Tm (Wireless standard: IEEE 802.11ax \(Wi-Fi 6\), backward compatible with 802.11a/b/g/n/ac.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 661.3 Tm (Bands: 2.4 GHz up to 574 Mbps and 5 GHz up to 2402 Mbps \(AX3000 class\).) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 645.3 Tm (Ports: one 2.5 Gbps WAN port, four 1 Gbps LAN ports and one USB 3.0 port for storage) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 629.4 Tm (sharing.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 613.4 Tm (Processor: 1.5 GHz quad-core. Memory: 512 MB RAM, 256 MB flash.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 597.5 Tm (Security: WPA3-Personal, WPA2/WPA3 mixed mode, built-in firewall and automatic security) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 581.5 Tm (updates.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 565.6 Tm (Maximum recommended number of connected devices: 64.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 549.6 Tm (Dimensions: 260 x 160 x 45 mm. Weight: 620 g. Power consumption: 18 W maximum.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 36 Tm (NetPro X200 User Manual | NP-X200-UM-EN rev C | Page 3 of 14) Tj
ET
