stream
BT
/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 762.8 Tm (4 Installation and First Setup) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 743.9 Tm (4.1 Connecting the hardware) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728.0 Tm (1. Turn off your modem.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712.0 Tm (2. Connect the blue WAN port of the router to the modem with the supplied Ethernet) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696.1 Tm (cable.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 680.1 Tm (3. Turn on the modem and wait 2 minutes.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 664.2 Tm (4. Connect the power adapter and press the power button. Wait until the status LED is) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 648.2 Tm (solid white or solid amber \(about 90 seconds\).) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 629.4 Tm (4.2 Setup with the NetPro app) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 613.4 Tm (Install the NetPro Home app \(iOS 15 or later, Android 9 or later\). Connect your phone) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 597.5 Tm (to the Wi-Fi network printed on the label on the bottom of the router \(default name) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 581.5 Tm (NetPro-X200-XXXX, where XXXX are the last four characters of the MAC address\).) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 565.6 Tm (Open the app, tap Add Device, and follow the instructions. The app detects the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 549.6 Tm (connection type automatically \(DHCP, PPPoE or static IP\).) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 36 Tm (NetPro X200 User Manual | NP-X200-UM-EN rev C | Page 5 of 14) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
