stream
BT
/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 762.8 Tm (6 Parental Controls and Guest Network) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 743.9 Tm (6.1 Guest network) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728.0 Tm (Go to Wireless > Guest Network and turn on the guest network for 2.4 GHz, 5 GHz or) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712.0 Tm (both. Guests get internet access but cannot see devices on your main network. You can) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696.1 Tm (limit guest access to 1, 4 or 24 hours, or set it to Always.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 677.2 Tm (6.2 Parental controls) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 661.3 Tm (Go to Advanced > Parental Controls. Create a profile for each family member, assign) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 645.3 Tm (their devices, then set daily time limits, bedtime schedules and content filters) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 629.4 Tm (\(Child, Pre-teen, Teen or Adult\). Paused devices lose internet access immediately.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 610.5 Tm (6.3 Quality of Service \(QoS\)) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 594.6 Tm (Adaptive QoS gives priority to video calls and gaming. Enable it under Advanced > QoS) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 578.6 Tm (and enter your real upload and download speeds measured with a speed test.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 36 Tm (NetPro X200 User Manual | NP-X200-UM-EN rev C | Page 8 of 14) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
