22 0 obj
<< /Length 1291 >>
stream
BT
/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 762.8 Tm (7 Firmware Update) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 746.8 Tm (NetPro releases firmware updates that add features and fix security issues. Automatic) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 730.9 Tm (updates are enabled by default and run between 2:00 and 4:00 at night.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712.0 Tm (7.1 Manual update) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 696.1 Tm (1. Download the latest firmware file for the X200 from support.netpro.example/x200.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 680.1 Tm (Make sure the file name starts with X200_FW.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 664.2 Tm (2. In the web interface go to System > Firmware Upgrade and click Browse to select the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 648.2 Tm (file.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 632.3 Tm (3. Click Upgrade. The update takes about 4 minutes and the status LED blinks white.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 616.3 Tm (4. Do not turn off the router or close the browser during the update. Interrupting the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 600.4 Tm (update can damage the router \(error E-301\).) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 584.4 Tm (Your settings are kept after a firmware update. Downgrading to a firmware older than) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 568.5 Tm (3.0 is not supported.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 36 Tm (NetPro X200 User Manual | NP-X200-UM-EN rev C | Page 9 of 14) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
