BT
/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 762.8 Tm (10 Error Codes) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 746.8 Tm (Error codes appear in the NetPro Home app and in the web interface under System > Log.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 730.9 Tm (E-101 WAN cable not detected: connect the modem to the blue WAN port and check the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 714.9 Tm (cable.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 699.0 Tm (E-102 PPPoE authentication failed: the PPPoE username or password is wrong. Re-enter) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 683.0 Tm (the credentials from your internet service provider.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 667.1 Tm (E-103 No IP address from the modem: restart the modem, wait 2 minutes, then restart the) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 651.1 Tm (router.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 635.2 Tm (E-201 Wireless radio overheating: the router reduced transmit power. Improve) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 619.2 Tm (ventilation and keep the router away from heat sources.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 603.3 Tm (E-202 Too many connected devices: more than 64 devices are connected. Disconnect unused) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 587.3 Tm (devices or enable the guest network for visitors.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 571.4 Tm (E-301 Firmware verification failed: the firmware is damaged, usually after an) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 555.4 Tm (interrupted update. Hold the RESET button while powering on the router for 30 seconds) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 539.5 Tm (to start recovery mode, then upload the firmware again from) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 523.5 Tm (http://192.168.50.1/recovery. If the LED stays solid red, contact support for a) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 507.6 Tm (replacement.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 491.6 Tm (E-401 USB storage error: the drive is not formatted as FAT32, exFAT or NTFS, or it) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 475.7 Tm (draws more than 900 mA.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 36 Tm (NetPro X200 User Manual | NP-X200-UM-EN rev C | Page 12 of 14) Tj
ET
